# Dashboard and API

- Cookie sessions + CSRF for browser; bearer OK for CLI. Use `web/src/api/client.ts` for conflict/error handling.
- Mutations send `revision` / `updatedAt` last read. Stale writes → `409 CONFIG_REVISION_CONFLICT` + refresh guidance. Never merge stale forms.
- Sanitize all mapping/account/settings responses — strip `appPassword`, cookies, keys, webhook secrets.
- Bluesky accounts API: list/create `/api/bluesky-accounts`; validate/rotate/delete under `/:id/*`. Delete linked account → `409`.
- Bulk destination actions: max 50; same OCC as single edits; destructive backfill needs typed confirm.
- UI: extend existing panels/hooks; **incremental** extraction from `DashboardApp.tsx` — no behavior-changing rewrite.
- Prefer existing `web/src/components/ui/` primitives (focus-trapped dialogs, a11y).
